                <mxCell id="n1" value="• Upload stays HTTP 202 (Frame 2). RAG /ingest returns 201 with triples_count after distillation.&#10;• Step 5 embeds text, image and video into ONE 2048-dim space — a text query can retrieve an image.&#10;• Fernet ciphertext is stored (metadata.encrypted_vector + document field). Chroma ANN still uses the float vector (HNSW cannot index ciphertext). Dummy-zero embeddings are forbidden.&#10;• Every Chroma query and Mongo Documents read is filtered by user_id. Cross-tenant get is 404.&#10;• LLM is the local Qwen3.5-4B host process (:8003), never AWS Bedrock. Vector store is Chroma only (Pinecone = future)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
